---
import LegalLayout from '~/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '~/data/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${site.name} collects, uses and protects personal information.`}
  updated="26 September 2026"
>
  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legalName} ("we", "us") provides energy, electrical and construction services. This policy
    explains what personal information we collect through this website, why we collect it, and the
    choices you have.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect only what we need to respond to you and deliver work you have asked for.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us.</strong> Name, email, phone number, property address, and details about your project submitted through our contact, quote or payment forms.</li>
    <li><strong>Payment information.</strong> Card details are entered on our payment provider's hosted page and are never transmitted to or stored on our servers. We receive only a confirmation, the amount and a reference.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical information.</strong> Standard server logs such as IP address, browser type and pages visited, used to keep the site secure and working.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to enquiries, prepare estimates and deliver contracted work.</li>
    <li>To process payments and issue receipts.</li>
    <li>To submit permit, interconnection, incentive and grant applications on your behalf, where you have engaged us to do so.</li>
    <li>To send service updates, and marketing messages only where you have opted in.</li>
    <li>To meet legal, tax and regulatory obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell personal information. We share it only where it is necessary:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>With service providers acting on our behalf, such as our payment processor and hosting provider, under contractual confidentiality obligations.</li>
    <li>With utilities, permitting authorities and funding bodies where you have asked us to act for you.</li>
    <li>Where required by law or to protect our legal rights.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiry records are kept for as long as needed to respond and for a reasonable period afterwards.
    Project and financial records are retained for the period required by tax, warranty and regulatory
    obligations.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You can unsubscribe from marketing email at any time using the link in any message.</li>
    <li>You can ask us for a copy of the personal information we hold about you, or ask us to correct or delete it, subject to the records we are legally required to keep.</li>
    <li>You can ask us to stop contacting you entirely.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To make any of these requests, email
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses only what is necessary to function. If analytics or marketing cookies are added
    later, this policy will be updated and consent will be requested before they are set.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served over HTTPS, and payment handling is delegated to a PCI-compliant processor. No
    system is perfectly secure, but we take reasonable technical and organisational measures to
    protect the information we hold.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    This site is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their personal
    information.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top reflects the most recent
    revision.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legalName}<br />
    {site.location.label}<br />
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> &middot;
    <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
